        "official_en_sha256": "5b03744bb1d056257835a3341afd2d6d44b689e2e17df2f940c65252e7d1aabc"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "グランシェルトには友達が住んでるのよ。\r\n戦争なんか起こさせないわ。",
        "official_en": "I’ve a friend that lives in Grandshelt. Like hell I’ll let a war happen.",
        "real_en": "I've got a friend living in Grandshelt. I'm not letting a war happen."
