        "official_en_sha256": "bc7333c3814795e9c64b37e2a28d30c4f84902e88217b50845e1390e3329fb07"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ジェイクと共に戦えたことは\r\n俺の一生の誇りだよ。",
        "official_en": "It’s been an honor fighting alongside Jake.",
        "real_en": "I'll be proud for the rest of my life that I got to fight alongside Jake."
