      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "今できる最上の作戦を考えました。\r\n犠牲を最小に、成果は最大に。",
        "official_en": "I have devised the optimal strategy given our current resources and circumstances. It is designed to achieve maximum effect while minimizing casualties.",
