        "official_en_sha256": "50dcfd3d4f5a2760e151f40c36d333d7b825cc19237a88c657fe324fdd191dff"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "要となるのは反乱軍の力でしたが、\r\nジェイクの人柄のおかげでしょうか。\r\n彼らは士気が高い。やれるはずです。",
        "official_en": "The plan hinges upon the morale of the rebels. Fortunately, with spirits so high, it shall pose no issue. I believe we have Jake’s charisma and leadership to thank for that.",
        "real_en": "The rebels' strength is crucial to the plan. Perhaps it's thanks to Jake's character, but their morale is high. They should be able to do it."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
