      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "革命は成功したが\r\nあんたらは旅を続けるんだろう？\r\n見て行ってくれ。",
        "official_en": "We won, but <text style=\"italic\">your</> fight’s still not over, right? Come take a look.",
        "real_en": "The revolution succeeded, but <text style=\"italic\">you're</> continuing your journey, right? Take a look."
